        <mxCell id="c144" value="&lt;b&gt;The model never has the last word.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; Its output is one input to a rule set that is written down, versioned and tested &amp;#8212; so the same claim always produces the same decision, and every decision can be explained to a regulator." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=27;fontColor=#14532D;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="90" y="858" width="1740" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
